  "description": "AdvancedWebView is a WebView for .NET MAUI (Android and iOS) with a JavaScript bridge that works with any site: two-way messages, C# handlers the page awaits as Promises, typed calls to page functions, injected scripts and styles, and per-origin security. It also exposes platform settings such as JavaScript, popups, scroll bounce, mixed content, file access and cache control.",
